From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Thurston <44538250+betamax80@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:42:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 06390: RISC-V: Add WCH/QingKe XW extension

ghidra-qingke-xw 1.1.1: WCH QingKe language for Ghidra 12.1.4

A Ghidra extension adding RISCV:LE:32:QingKe-XW: WCH's XW compressed
byte/half-word loads and stores (LLVM's Xwchc), ratified Zba/Zbb/Zbs/Zbc
with p-code, Zicond, and WCH's custom instructions. Apache-2.0.

tools/build.py builds and installs it against a given Ghidra;
proof/xwproof.py checks it against llvm-objdump, WCH's GCC objdump and
Ghidra's emulator.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
